25:["$","p",null,{"children":["Two things are true about it. The first is that it is not authentication: the\nvalue it gates on is caller-supplied and never verified against anything, so any\nclient can claim any identity. The second is that it does not read the header\nyou name. ",["$","code",null,{"children":"required"}]," is passed to the telemetry layer, which looks for an\nOpenTelemetry ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Baggage"}]," entry named ",["$","code",null,{"children":"enduser.id"}],", and rejects the request with\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"FAILED_PRECONDITION"}]," when that entry is absent:"]}]
